<h1 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-1.BusinessContext">1. Busines=
s Context</h1>
<p>NBIN is onboarding Client firms that have ongoing integration (SSO) with=
 their own SPs and hence must continue to use their own IDP for authenticat=
ion but have SSO experience for their users with Compass-X.</p>
<p>Clients to be onboarded this quarter:</p>
<p>=E2=96=AASunlife (Azure AD)</p>
<p>=E2=96=AAIAPW (Okta)</p>
