<h1 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-5.RecommendedSolution">5. Rec=
ommended Solution</h1>
<h2 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-5.1Phase-1:SupportExternalIDP=
sforAuthentication">5.1 Phase - 1: Support External IDPs for Authentication=
</h2>
<p><span class=3D"jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"GPTSD-836" data-client-id=3D=
"SINGLE_6770dc6c-0646-39a6-a1ea-561a14a12e2f_1678277031_8ab247629ffb6d5c01a=
0066f1fcb0034"> <a href=3D"https://jira.bnc.ca/browse/GPTSD-836" class=3D"j=
ira-issue-key"><span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-wait issue-placeholder"></s=
pan>GPTSD-836</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Getting issue details...</span>=
 <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-default issue-pl=
aceholder">STATUS</span> </span></p>
<h3 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-5.1.1Objectives"><strong>5.1.=
1 Objectives</strong></h3>
<ol>
 <li>Establish a pattern for External IDP integration</li>
 <li>Ensure no credentials are shared as part of this federation</li>
 <li>Strive to establish a Client IDP product / technology agnostic pattern=
</li>
 <li>Migrate existing users with no impact on their access setup in Compass=
</li>
 <li>Allow differentiation of users using authentication groups i.e. users =
authentication by NBC Employee IDP, NBC NBIN IDP and other external IDPs</l=
i>
 <li>Only allow identity management for user identities managed via NBC NBI=
N IDP</li>
 <li>Well defined user-lifecycle management</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-5.1.2Strategy">5.1.2 <strong>=
Strategy</strong></h3>
<ol>
 <li>Use Okta=E2=80=99s External IDP social sign-in feature to setup Extern=
al IDP</li>
 <li>Use JIT provisioning to auto-create Okta user profile on the first log=
in</li>
 <li>Use Account linking to keep Okta profile updated with user profile cha=
nges on External IDP</li>
 <li>Setup Okta user profiles to off-board after a fixed duration of inacti=
vity</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-5.1.3Solution">5.1.3 Solution=
</h3>
<h4 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-1.Terminology">1. Terminology=
</h4>
<ol>
 <li>Access Profile - User access profile comprises of all coarse and fine =
grain access control for Compass.</li>
 <li>External SSO profile - The user profile on NBC IDP that is linked to a=
n external IDP. This disables user identity management and login on NBC IDP=
.</li>
</ol>
<h4 id=3D"FUMCapability:BringYourOwnIdP(BYOI)-2.ProcessFlow">2. Process Flo=
w</h4>
<div class=3D"rwui_expandable_item rw_open">
 <button class=3D"rwui_expandable_item_title rwui_expand" role=3D"button" o=
nclick=3D"RWUI.toggleExpandItem(this, event);" id=3D"rwui_expand-Compasspro=
cessflow" data-hash=3D"expand-Compassprocessflow" aria-expanded=3D"true">
